<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (The IoT-Based Blood Pressure Monitoring System is a smart healthcare solution designed for real-time heart rate monitoring using the ESP8266 NodeMCU and MAX30102 sensor. The system measures BPM \(heart rate\), processes the data, and transmits it wirelessly to Google Firebase for cloud storage and live monitoring.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (A web dashboard displays real-time readings, historical trends, and allows data export in CSV and PDF formats. LED indicators provide instant alerts for normal and abnormal BPM levels. The project demonstrates an affordable and efficient IoT-based healthcare monitoring system suitable for remote patient monitoring and academic applications.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
