/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (The IoT-based blood pressure monitoring system is a smart healthcare project that enables continuous and real-time monitoring of heart rate using IoT technology. The system uses the ESP8266 NodeMCU microcontroller and MAX30102 sensor to measure BPM \(heart rate\) and transmit the data wirelessly to Google Firebase Realtime Database.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (The collected data can be viewed through a live web dashboard, allowing users and caregivers to monitor health conditions remotely. The system also includes LED indicators to show normal, alert, and data transmission status. This project aims to provide a low-cost, efficient, and user-friendly solution for remote healthcare monitoring.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
