<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (The IoT-Based Blood Pressure Monitoring System successfully demonstrates an efficient and low-cost healthcare monitoring solution using IoT technology. The project integrates the ESP8266 NodeMCU, MAX30102 sensor, and Google Firebase Realtime Database to continuously monitor and transmit heart-rate data in real time.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (The system provides several important features such as live BPM monitoring, cloud-based data storage, historical data visualization, and CSV/PDF report generation through a user-friendly web dashboard. The inclusion of LED indicators for normal, alert, and transmission status improves usability and provides immediate feedback to users.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
