<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (Overall, the proposed system offers a reliable, scalable, and economical solution for remote patient monitoring, home healthcare, and academic research. With future enhancements such as SpO2 monitoring, multi-patient support, and improved security features, the system can be further developed into a more advanced smart healthcare solution.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
