227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (The IoT-Based Blood Pressure Monitoring System can be further enhanced by integrating additional healthcare features such as SpO2 monitoring and actual blood pressure measurement using a digital BP cuff. The system can also be expanded to support multiple patients and devices through a centralized cloud dashboard for hospital or clinic use. Advanced technologies like Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning can be implemented to detect abnormal heart patterns and provide early health warnings. Future versions may include battery-powered wearable designs, deep sleep functionality for power efficiency, and SMS/email alert systems for emergency notifications. Security can also be improved through data encryption, Firebase Authentication, and role-based access control to ensure safe and secure healthcare monitoring.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
